#: text_calendar.cpp:277
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The invitation attachment \"%1\" is a web link that is inaccessible from "
"this computer. Please ask the event organizer to resend the invitation with "
"this attachment stored inline instead of a link."
msgstr ""
"De Inladen-Bilaag \"%1\" is en Nettlink, op den sik vun dissen Reekner nich "
"togriepen lett. Fraag bitte den Utrichter vun't Begeefnis, wat he de Inladen "
"nochmaal mit de Bilaag binnenreegs ansteed as Link loosstüern kann."

